do freeze(0.25)
do se("crow")
shinpachi: 錯的是—— [#source:R35e-1]
kagura: 還沒講完阿魯。插嘴的眼鏡最討厭了阿魯。 [#source:R35e-2]
=> ch1_r3_combo

~ ch1_r3_qte_late
do freeze(0.25)
do se("crow")
